#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.4.rst:3
msgid "Version 4.5.4"
msgstr "버전 4.5.4"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.4.rst:5
msgid "Release Date: July 27, 2024"
msgstr "릴리스 날짜: 2024년 7월 27일"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.4.rst:7
msgid "**4.5.4 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr "**CodeIgniter4 4.5.4 릴리스**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.4.rst:15
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr "버그 수정"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.4.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Routing:** Fixed a bug that filters passed to ``$routes->group()`` were"
" not merged into filters passed to the inner routes."
msgstr ""
"**라우팅:** ``$routes->group()``\ 에 전달된 필터가 내부 라우트에 전달된 필터와 병합되지 않던 버그가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.4.rst:19
msgid ""
"**CURLRequest:** Fixed a bug preventing the use of strings for "
"``version`` in the config array when making requests."
msgstr ""
"**CURLRequest:** 요청 시 설정 배열의 ``version``\ 에 문자열을 사용할 수 없던 버그가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.4.rst:22
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""
"수정된 버그의 전체 목록은 저장소의 `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_\ 를 참고하세요."
